# Shell scripts run under Bash on macOS/Linux and must keep LF line endings, even
# in a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true. The release package is built from the
# working tree, so the line endings of the checkout are the line endings that ship.
*.sh text eol=lf

# The launcher HANDOFF.cmd is a Windows batch file: cmd.exe reads it line by line and
# needs CRLF line endings, even in a clone made on macOS or Linux.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
